      "refersTo": "checklist-panel",
      "description": "Flat bordered checklist container; progress is filled only from local state.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-checklist\" aria-label=\"Setup checklist\"><h2>Setup checklist</h2><p>Progress is saved in this browser, just for you.</p></section>",
